# Hand-authored bilingual teaching notes. Keys are first source lines of blocks.
NOTES={}
def add(file, rows): NOTES[file]=rows
add('00_helpers.R',[
(1,'Reusable tools / 可复用工具','A function is a named recipe: defining it does not yet analyse the data. Its arguments are inputs, and its returned value can be reused. These small helpers keep every output consistent; read their definitions now and revisit them when called later.','函数就是有名字的操作步骤；定义函数不等于已经分析数据。括号里的参数是输入，返回值可以交给下一步使用。本节把重复操作写成工具，后面遇到调用时可以回来对照。'),
(2,'Save a result table / 保存结果表','tab() writes a data frame to ROOT/tables/name.csv. paste0 joins text without spaces; file.path constructs a platform-appropriate path. row.names=FALSE avoids an extra artificial index column, and na="" exports unavailable values as blanks: a blank is not zero. invisible(x) returns the object without printing it.','tab() 把数据表保存为 ROOT/tables/name.csv。paste0 无空格拼接文字，file.path 组合路径；row.names=FALSE 避免额外行号列。na="" 把无法计算的值存为空白，空白绝不能读成 0。invisible(x) 返回对象但不自动打印。'),
(7,'Draw and close a figure / 绘图与关闭设备','png() opens an image device, so subsequent plotting commands draw into a file. par() sets shared appearance; it does not change observations. force(expr) runs the plotting expression supplied by the caller. on.exit(dev.off()) closes the device even if the function exits early, preventing incomplete image files.','png() 打开图片输出设备，之后的绘图命令会画进文件。par() 只设置外观，不改变数据；force(expr) 执行调用时传入的绘图代码。on.exit(dev.off()) 保证函数退出时关闭设备，防止图片没有写完整。'),
(15,'Formatting and quantiles / 格式与分位数','fmt() changes display precision, not the stored estimate. ptext() reports very small p-values as <0.001 instead of misleading zero. q(x,.99) finds the 99th percentile: about 99% of observations lie at or below this threshold, subject to ties and interpolation. It is not a 99% confidence interval.','fmt() 只改变展示小数位，不修改真实估计。ptext() 把极小 p 值写为 <0.001，而不是误导性的 0。q(x,.99) 是第 99 百分位：大约 99% 的观察值不高于它，需考虑并列值和插值；它不是 99% 置信区间。'),
(18,'Skewness and one-variable summaries / 偏度与单变量概括','skew() uses standardised third moments; a long right tail usually makes this positive. summary_numeric() returns count, missingness, location, spread and extreme-value indicators together. SD describes spread in the original units, whereas skewness describes shape. W3 teaches why a mean alone is insufficient.','skew() 用标准化三阶中心矩衡量偏斜，长右尾通常让它为正。summary_numeric() 同时返回数量、缺失、位置、离散程度和极端值指标。标准差有原变量单位，偏度描述形状。对应 W3：不能只报一个均值。'),
(23,'Describe each group / 为每组建立画像','lapply repeats a function for each group; do.call(rbind,...) stacks the resulting rows. dat[rows,columns] selects a rectangle, while [[v]] extracts a column by its name. Means and medians use the ORIGINAL data. mean(Income==0) works because TRUE behaves as 1 and FALSE as 0, yielding a proportion.','lapply 对每个群执行同样步骤，do.call(rbind,...) 把结果上下合并。dat[行,列] 选子表，[[v]] 按变量名取列。均值和中位数使用原始数据。mean(Income==0) 能算比例，因为 TRUE 相当于 1、FALSE 相当于 0。'),
(35,'Compare two clusterings / 比较两次分群','ARI counts pairs placed together and adjusts agreement for chance. choose2(x)=x(x-1)/2 counts pairs within x records. The table aligns memberships without requiring the same label numbers: cluster 1 in one run need not be cluster 1 in another. ARI=1 means identical partitions; this measures agreement, not business truth.','ARI 比较两次分组对记录配对的判断，并扣除随机一致部分。choose2(x)=x(x-1)/2 是 x 条记录能组成的配对数。交叉表不要求两次群号相同；这次的 1 群可能对应另一次的 4 群。ARI=1 表示完全一致，但一致不代表业务上必然正确。'),
(43,'Check convergence / 检查算法是否停稳','The Lloyd implementation may omit ifault, so absence is accepted rather than treated as failure. We also require a finite iteration count strictly below iter.max. This detects computational failure; it cannot prove that k-means found a unique or global best partition.','Lloyd 实现可能没有 ifault 字段，因此不存在该字段不算出错。同时要求迭代次数有限且小于上限。检查针对计算是否正常结束，不能证明找到了唯一解或全局最优解。'),
(48,'Calculate prediction errors / 计算预测误差','RMSE=sqrt(mean(error^2)) gives extra weight to large misses; MAE=mean(abs(error)) is easier to read in dollars. R2=1-SSE/SST compares squared error with the outcome mean in the evaluated set and may be negative on test data. mean_error uses predicted-minus-observed, so a positive value indicates average overprediction.','RMSE 是平方误差平均后开方，特别重视大错误；MAE 是绝对误差的平均值，单位仍为金额。R²=1−SSE/SST 以当前评价数据的结果均值作参照，测试 R² 可能为负。mean_error 使用预测减实际，正值表示整体高估；它与后面残差的符号相反。'),
(51,'HC3 covariance / HC3 稳健协方差','X is the model matrix including the intercept; crossprod(X) is X-transpose times X. The sandwich multiplies an inverse information matrix, a residual-based middle matrix, and the inverse again. Dividing residuals by 1-leverage increases the contribution of influential design positions. HC3 adjusts coefficient uncertainty under unequal variance; fitted predictions stay unchanged.','X 是含截距的模型矩阵，crossprod(X) 表示 X 的转置乘 X。三明治形式是逆矩阵、残差信息矩阵、逆矩阵相乘。残差除以 1−杠杆值，提高特殊设计位置的影响。HC3 调整异方差下的系数不确定性，不改变预测值，也不修复因果问题。'),
(56,'Coefficients and intervals / 系数与区间','coef() extracts model coefficients, including the intercept; diag() extracts covariance diagonal entries and sqrt gives standard errors. A 95% interval is estimate plus or minus a t critical value times its HC3 SE. Classical and robust values are retained side by side. Small p-values concern conditional association under model assumptions, not the probability that a business action succeeds.','coef() 取全部系数（含截距），diag() 取协方差矩阵对角线，开方得到标准误。95% 区间等于估计值加减 t 临界值乘 HC3 标准误。保留常规与稳健两套结果便于比较。小 p 值描述模型前提下的条件关联，不能解释为业务行动成功概率。'),
(64,'VIF / 方差膨胀因子','Each predictor is regressed on the other predictors, producing an auxiliary R2. VIF=1/(1-R2): strong overlap inflates coefficient uncertainty. drop=FALSE preserves a matrix even when only one column remains. W8 uses VIF to examine collinearity; a low VIF does not validate every other regression assumption.','把每个预测变量对其他预测变量回归，得到辅助 R²；VIF=1/(1−R²)。信息重复越多，系数不确定性越大。drop=FALSE 保持矩阵结构，即使只剩一列。对应 W8 的共线性检查；VIF 低不能说明其他假设都成立。'),
(71,'Safe HTML text / 安全显示报告文字','HTML uses <, > and & as special syntax. Replacing them with entities makes data display as text. html_table() then converts data frames into readable tables, treating p-values specially. This section formats existing results; it does not estimate another statistical model.','HTML 把 <、>、& 当特殊语法，替换成实体后才能按普通文字展示。html_table() 将数据框转换为表格，并特别处理 p 值格式。本节只组织既有结果，不另做统计建模。')])
add('01_data_eda.R',[
(1,'Read and validate the source / 读取并检查数据','SOURCE identifies the CSV and md5sum creates a fingerprint to detect later changes. check.names=FALSE preserves the original column names. Cat_Age is excluded from numeric summaries because its digits encode categories, not a meaningful continuous scale. stopifnot halts the analysis when essential data assumptions fail; it never silently repairs the data.','SOURCE 指向 CSV，md5sum 生成指纹便于检查文件是否改变。check.names=FALSE 保留原列名。Cat_Age 虽然用数字编码，却是类别，因此不放进连续变量概括。stopifnot 在数据不符合预期时停止，不会静默修改原始数据。'),
(11,'Create analysis indicators / 新建分析标记','row_id is a traceable row number, not a true customer identifier. Under30 and IncomeZero are 0/1 indicators produced from logical comparisons. cut() makes explicit age intervals; the first interval includes ages 18 through 29. These additions leave all seven original columns intact.','row_id 只是追踪用行号，不是真实客户 ID。Under30 和 IncomeZero 把逻辑判断变成 0/1 标记。cut() 明确划出年龄段，第一段为 18–29 岁。新增这些列不改变原始七列。'),
(16,'Verify age-category meaning / 核对年龄类别含义','aggregate() summarises numeric age within each recorded category. Nested ifelse reconstructs the observed coding rule, and the assertion checks every record against it. This prevents treating Cat_Age=2 (18-35) as equivalent to Under30. W3 measurement levels guide the distinction between codes and quantities.','aggregate() 汇总每个类别对应的数值年龄，嵌套 ifelse 重建编码规则，再逐行验证。Cat_Age=2 实际覆盖 18–35 岁，因此不能代替 30 岁以下。这里应用 W3 的测量水平：编码与数量不是一回事。'),
(22,'Audit trail and dictionary / 审计记录与变量字典','The audit counts missing cells, repeated value rows, zero income and negative profits. Identical values do not prove identical customers, because customer IDs are absent. The dictionary records what each variable means and what is unknown, including income and transaction reporting periods. Do not relabel Income as annual salary without evidence.','审计表记录缺失、重复值组合、零收入和负利润。没有客户 ID 时，相同数值不能证明是同一个人。字典同时记录已知含义与未知信息，例如收入和交易次数的统计周期。不能自行把 Income 称为年薪。'),
(37,'Univariate summaries and frequencies / 单变量统计与频数','The helper summarises every numeric variable; the loop builds count and proportion tables for product counts and age codes. A frequency answers how many records have each value, whereas the mean answers their arithmetic centre. Read median, SD and range together when the mean is pulled by extreme values. Classroom anchor: W3.','先概括每个数值变量，再为产品数和年龄类别生成频数与比例。频数回答每个值有多少人，均值回答算术中心在哪里。遇到极端值拉高均值，要一起看中位数、标准差和范围。对应 W3。'),
(44,'Screen unusual observations / 筛查异常观察值','IQR=Q3-Q1 describes the middle half of the data. Values outside Q1-1.5*IQR and Q3+1.5*IQR are flags, not automatic mistakes. The top-ten exports make unusual records traceable using row_id. Nothing in this block removes records or overwrites amounts.','IQR=Q3−Q1 描述中间一半数据的跨度。超出 Q1−1.5×IQR 或 Q3+1.5×IQR 只是被标记，不自动等于错误。另存最高十条记录便于按行号核查。本段不删记录，也不覆盖金额。'),
(52,'Compare descriptive profiles / 比较描述画像','These calls summarise zero versus positive income, age bands, under-30 status and exact ages. A profile shows what the sample looks like before formal tests. Zero income alongside transactions motivates checking the recording process; it does not establish that the income value is missing.','分别查看零收入与正收入、年龄段、30 岁以下及逐岁画像。画像先说明样本长什么样，再决定是否检验。零收入但有交易提示需要核实记录过程，不能直接证明该收入是缺失值。'),
(60,'Correlation and repeated tests / 相关与多重检验','combn chooses every pair of numeric variables. Pearson uses original magnitudes and measures linear association; Spearman correlates ranks and is less sensitive to extreme magnitudes. Holm adjusts a family of p-values because searching many pairs increases false-positive opportunities. Repeating Pearson without the maximum Yield is a sensitivity check, not the replacement main analysis. W6 covers correlation.','combn 列出数值变量的两两组合。Pearson 用原始数值看线性关联，Spearman 用排序降低极端金额的影响。一次做许多检验会增加偶然显著机会，所以用 Holm 调整 p 值。去掉最大 Yield 后重算只是敏感性检查，不替代主分析。对应 W6。'),
(73,'Two-group means / 两组均值比较','Welch t.test compares group 1 minus group 0 while allowing unequal variances. For Under30, a negative difference means younger records have lower recorded outcomes. The confidence interval concerns a population mean difference under assumptions, not a range for 95% of customers. A standardised difference divides by pooled SD for scale-free description. W4 introduces two-group comparisons.','Welch t.test 比较 1 组减 0 组，并允许方差不同。对 Under30，负差值表示年轻组记录结果较低。置信区间描述前提下总体均值差的不确定性，不是 95% 客户所在范围。再除以合并标准差得到无单位差异。对应 W4 的两组比较。'),
(86,'Chi-square and effect size / 卡方检验与效应量','table() cross-tabulates age band and zero-income status. Chi-square compares observed counts with expected counts under independence; check minimum_expected before relying on the approximation. CramersV describes association size, unlike the p-value. prop.table(...,1) divides each row by its total, producing within-age-band percentages.','table() 建立年龄段与零收入状态的列联表。卡方比较观察人数与独立假设下的期望人数，需检查最小期望频数。Cramér V 描述关联大小，p 值则不是效应大小。prop.table(...,1) 按每行总数相除，得到年龄段内部比例。'),
(94,'More than two groups / 多组均值比较','Classical ANOVA is retained to connect with W6, while Welch ANOVA allows unequal variances. Brown-Forsythe compares absolute distances from group medians as a variance diagnostic. eta_squared is the classical between-group sum-of-squares fraction and is not a conversion of Welch F. Pairwise Welch comparisons with Holm indicate which age-band pairs differ; they remain observational comparisons.','保留经典 ANOVA 对照 W6，同时以允许方差不同的 Welch ANOVA 为主。Brown–Forsythe 比较各记录到组内中位数的绝对距离，检查方差差异。eta_squared 是经典组间平方和占比，不是把 Welch F 转换所得。后续逐对 Welch 与 Holm 用于比较年龄段，仍然只是观察性差异。'),
(109,'Distribution figures / 分布图','mfrow=c(2,3) arranges six panels and hist() groups values into bins. Full-range histograms and boxplots expose long tails rather than hiding them. A very compressed central box can itself be evidence of extreme magnitudes. The PNG files are evidence to inspect, not tests that approve data automatically.','mfrow=c(2,3) 排列六格，hist() 把数值分箱。全范围直方图与箱线图用来揭示长尾，而不是藏起尾部。中心箱体被挤得很小也可能说明极端值很大。图片供人检查，不会自动判定数据合格。'),
(119,'Age and CLV figures / 年龄与 CLV 图','The scatter view stops at the 99th CLV percentile for readability, while the orange line uses all age-specific observations. outline=FALSE hides boxplot outlier markers only. The reference line at 30 marks the assignment question. None of these display settings deletes observations from tests or models.','散点图纵轴显示到 CLV 第 99 百分位以便阅读，橙线仍使用每个年龄的全部记录。outline=FALSE 只隐藏箱线图离群点标记。30 岁参考线对应作业问题。这些显示设置不删除检验或模型中的记录。'),
(128,'Associations and zero-income graphics / 关联与零收入图','Scatterplots compare CLV with four variables; transparent dots reduce overlap. The zero-income bar plot multiplies proportions by 100 to show percentages. Its transaction boxplots ask whether zero-income records still contain activity. write.csv then saves the enriched data; the source CSV remains unchanged.','散点图比较 CLV 与四个变量，透明点有助于看重叠。零收入柱状图把比例乘 100 显示为百分比，交易箱线图检查这些记录是否仍活跃。最后保存新增分析标记的数据，源 CSV 保持不变。')])
add('02_clusters.R',[
(1,'Choose active variables / 选择主动变量','Tot_Prod, Income, No_Trans and Age define similarity. Yield and CLV are passive outcomes: using them to form groups and then claiming discovered profitability differences would be circular. Cat_Age is omitted because numeric Age already represents age. This implements the input-selection discussion in W7.','产品数、收入、交易数和年龄定义相似性。Yield 与 CLV 是被动结果，不能先按盈利分组，再声称发现了盈利差异。年龄已用 Age 表达，不再重复加入 Cat_Age。对应 W7 的变量选择。'),
(6,'Limit extreme distances / 限制极端距离','Copy only clustering inputs, estimate p99 for income and transactions, then pmin replaces values above the thresholds with those thresholds. This is upper winsorisation for distance calculations, not row deletion. Profiles will still use d, which retains original values. The choice is revisited in sensitivity analysis.','只复制聚类输入，为收入和交易算第 99 百分位，再用 pmin 把超限输入限制在阈值。它只限制距离计算，不删除客户。画像仍使用保留原值的 d，后面还会检查这种选择是否影响分群。'),
(11,'Standardise / 标准化','scale() computes z=(x-mean)/SD for each column. For example, a value one SD above its mean becomes z=1 regardless of whether the original unit is years or money. The assertions verify means near zero and SDs near one. Standardisation prevents large units dominating Euclidean distance; it does not make skewed data normal. W3 and W7 both motivate this.','scale() 对每列计算 z=(x−均值)/标准差。例如比均值高一个标准差都变为 z=1，不管原来单位是岁还是金额。断言检查均值约为 0、标准差约为 1。标准化防止大单位主导欧氏距离，却不会把偏态数据变成正态。对应 W3、W7。'),
(14,'Shared evaluation sample / 共用评价样本','set.seed fixes the random stream so reruns are reproducible. We choose the same 2,500 row positions for every candidate silhouette comparison. dist() computes pairwise Euclidean distances; list() creates containers for fitted models and result rows. A shared sample makes k comparisons less affected by changing sampled customers.','set.seed 固定随机流便于复现。所有候选 k 都使用同一批 2,500 条记录算抽样 silhouette。dist() 计算两两欧氏距离，list() 建立存放模型与结果的容器。共用样本避免每次换人干扰群数比较。'),
(18,'Fit candidate k-means solutions / 拟合不同群数','For k=2 through 8, kmeans alternates assigning points to nearby centres and updating centres. nstart=50 tries fifty random starts and keeps the lowest within-cluster sum of squares. Silhouette compares own-group distance with the nearest other group: near zero indicates overlap. We also save smallest/largest group sizes and original-data profiles; no single score explains a segment.','依次拟合 2 到 8 群，kmeans 在分配客户和更新中心之间迭代。nstart=50 尝试五十个随机起点并保留组内平方和最低者。silhouette 比较本群与最近其他群距离，接近 0 说明重叠。还保存群规模与原始画像，因为一个分数解释不了业务群体。'),
(30,'Shortlist and exact confirmation / 入围与全样本复核','Stack candidate rows, then use a 2% minimum group size as an analyst feasibility rule. The best two sampled scores are shortlisted. Full distances for 10,000 records require roughly 50 million pairs, so this step can take memory and time. Only shortlisted full silhouettes are computed; all other values remain NA, meaning not calculated, not zero.','合并候选结果，以最小群占 2% 作为分析者设定的可操作规则。抽样得分最高的两个方案入围。10,000 条记录约有五千万个距离配对，这一步需要内存与时间。仅对入围方案算完整 silhouette，其他保留 NA，表示未算，不是 0。'),
(43,'Choose six with a disclosed tradeoff / 说明六群选择的取舍','Two groups score about 0.3205 and six about 0.3163, a difference of only 0.0042. PROFILE_REVIEW_K=6 is an explicit analyst decision after reviewing profiles, not an automatic best-score claim. W7 favours simplicity for close scores, so two remains a valid alternative. Six preserves useful age/product/activity distinctions at the cost of extra complexity.','两群约 0.3205、六群约 0.3163，只差 0.0042。PROFILE_REVIEW_K=6 明确记录看过画像后的人工判断，不是假装它得分最高。W7 提醒分数接近时重视简单方案，所以两群仍合理。六群保留年龄、产品与活跃度差异，代价是执行更复杂。'),
(52,'Document candidate profiles / 保存候选画像对比','For each shortlisted solution, calculate ranges of mean ages, product counts and transactions, plus profit medians and CLV means. These show what is merged or separated as k changes. Passive outcomes help interpret the choice, so subsequent significance tests are exploratory rather than independent confirmation.','对每个入围方案记录群均龄、产品数、交易数的跨度及盈利中位数和 CLV 均值，说明改变 k 后哪些差异被合并或分开。被动盈利结果参与了解释选择，因此后续群间显著性是探索性描述，不是独立确认。'),
(64,'Give stable labels / 固定可复述的群号','k-means numeric labels have no natural ordering. Sorting centres by mean age and then income creates a consistent C1-C6 narrative; match() translates old labels into this order. The centres and membership are reordered together so their meanings remain aligned. This renames groups without changing who belongs together.','k-means 群号没有天然顺序。按均龄、再按收入排序形成可复述的 C1–C6，match() 将旧号映射为新号。中心和成员标签一起重排，防止表与模型对不上。只是改名，没有改变谁与谁同群。'),
(72,'Original-scale business profiles / 原量纲业务画像','Compute means and medians on uncapped data, then sum profit and CLV by group. Divide totals by the overall total to measure contribution shares. Mean profit and total profit answer different questions: a large moderate-profit group can contribute more overall than a small high-profit group.','在未截尾原始数据上算画像，再对每群 Yield 和 CLV 求总和，并除以全体总和得到贡献份额。平均利润与总利润是不同问题：规模大的中等盈利群，总贡献可能超过规模小的高盈利群。'),
(79,'Name and export segments / 命名与导出群体','Names follow observed mean income, age, product count and activity thresholds. They do not invent occupation or specific products. vapply returns exactly one character name per group; the duplicate-name fallback adds numeric suffixes. Export numeric profiles, category proportions and row-level membership so every summary can be traced.','命名依据观察到的收入、年龄、产品数和活跃度阈值，不臆造职业或具体产品。vapply 要求每群返回一个文字名称；如名称重复就添加群号。导出数值画像、类别比例和逐行归属，方便追溯每个汇总值。'),
(96,'Record quality and release memory / 记录质量并释放内存','The selected full silhouette and fraction below zero describe separation and potentially awkward assignments. Negative silhouette does not prove data error. rm() removes large distance objects after use and gc() asks R to recover unused memory. Neither operation deletes source files or customer observations.','记录完整 silhouette 均值和负值比例，说明分群分离度与边界归属情况。负 silhouette 不能证明数据错误。rm() 在用完后移除大距离对象，gc() 回收内存；它们不删除源文件或客户记录。'),
(104,'Random-start stability / 随机起点稳定性','Refit the same six-group specification with five different seeds, using thirty starts each. ARI compares membership with the primary solution while allowing label permutations. Near-one agreement supports computational stability for this preprocessing. It says nothing yet about stability when income coding changes.','用五个不同随机种子重拟合同一个六群方案，每次三十个起点。ARI 比较成员归属且不受群号交换影响。接近 1 说明固定处理下计算较稳定，还不能说明改变收入处理后也稳定。'),
(113,'Alternative preprocessing scenarios / 替代预处理方案','Create uncapped, log-income, imputed-zero and no-income scenarios. log1p(x)=log(1+x) compresses large positive values while accepting zero. Imputation uses positive-income medians within age categories as a hypothetical alternative; it does not discover actual missing incomes. Primary recorded zeros are retained.','构造不封顶、收入取对数、零值填补、排除收入四种方案。log1p(x)=log(1+x) 压缩大值且能处理零。填补使用同年龄类别正收入中位数，只是假设情景，不代表查到了真实收入。主方案仍保留记录零值。'),
(120,'Measure preprocessing sensitivity / 衡量处理敏感性','Each alternative is standardised in its own input space and refitted. ARI quantifies changed membership and profiles show practical changes. A silhouette from a different transformed space is not directly a proof of a more truthful segmentation. The exercise exposes dependence on choices rather than hiding alternative answers.','每种方案在自己的变量空间内标准化后重拟合。ARI 量化成员变化，画像说明实际差异。不同变换空间的 silhouette 不能直接证明哪个分群更真实。这一步是公开结果对选择的依赖。'),
(133,'Compare passive outcomes / 比较被动盈利结果','Welch tests compare cluster means in Yield and CLV without requiring equal variances. The accompanying effect size and medians are essential because large samples can make small differences significant. Holm-adjusted pairwise comparisons reduce multiple-testing false positives. These are descriptive exploratory comparisons, not causal effects of cluster membership.','Welch 比较各群 Yield 与 CLV 均值，不要求方差相等。大样本会让很小差异显著，因此要同时看效应量和中位数。逐对检验用 Holm 降低多重比较误报。这些是探索性画像比较，不是加入某群导致的因果收益。'),
(144,'Save the fitted recipe / 保存完整拟合方案','saveRDS stores the model, variable names, caps, means, SDs and label map. Future use needs these exact training choices; simply calling scale() on a new customer batch changes the coordinate system. Saving membership also permits independent checks of centroids and counts.','saveRDS 保存模型、变量名、阈值、均值、标准差及群号映射。后续使用需要同一套尺度，不能对新客户重新 scale() 后还当作原坐标。保存成员归属也便于独立核对中心和人数。'),
(148,'Plot selection and profiles / 绘制选择依据与画像','The first figure compares shared-sample silhouettes and exact shortlisted scores, with an elbow plot as supporting evidence. Standardised centres show relative input patterns; group-size bars show operational scale. Mean and median profitability are displayed together to expose tail-driven differences. Read these as complementary views rather than a single automatic pass/fail test.','第一图同时展示共用样本分数、入围完整分数和辅助 elbow 图。标准化中心展示相对特征，人数柱展示规模。盈利均值与中位数并列，揭示尾部对均值的影响。几种图需合读，不能只靠一张图自动判定通过。')])
add('03_models.R',[
(1,'Prepare alternative age shapes / 准备年龄的不同形式','Age_c=Age-45 makes the intercept refer to age 45 rather than age zero; it does not standardise by SD. Age_c2 permits curvature. pmax(Age-30,0) creates a continuous hinge: zero until age 30, increasing thereafter. These candidate shapes address the assignment age question without assuming all patterns are linear.','Age_c=Age−45 让截距对应 45 岁而不是 0 岁；这不是除以标准差的标准化。Age_c2 允许弯曲关系；pmax(Age−30,0) 建立 30 岁前为零、之后递增的连续折线项。三种形状用于检查年龄问题，而不是预设关系必为直线。'),
(11,'Split related predictor patterns together / 将相同输入组合一起切分','paste() creates a key from product count, transactions and age. Equal keys remain together in either training or testing, reducing leakage of identical predictor patterns. Split within under-30 strata to retain that subgroup in both partitions. A 20% key sample need not yield exactly 20% of rows; no customer ID exists to guarantee person-level independence.','paste() 将产品数、交易数、年龄拼成键。相同键整体进入训练或测试，降低相同输入组合跨边界的信息泄漏。按是否 30 岁以下分层抽键，保证两边包含该群。20% 的键不一定等于 20% 的行；没有 ID 仍不能证明客户层面独立。'),
(21,'Five training folds / 五个训练折','Assign each unique training key to one of five folds and map all associated rows to that fold. Validation rotates which fold is withheld, while the separate test set stays outside fitting and selection. Save row assignments so the split is auditable. This is an extension beyond basic W8 fitting to check generalisation.','把每个训练键分到五折之一，同键的所有行跟随该折。交叉验证轮流留出一折，独立测试集不参与拟合和选择。保存逐行切分便于审计。这是对 W8 基础拟合的补充，用于检查泛化。'),
(30,'Candidate formulas and cross-validation / 候选公式与交叉验证','In R, outcome ~ predictors describes a model, and + adds terms; lm includes an intercept by default. Fit each candidate on four folds and predict the fifth, repeating five times. Pool squared errors weighted by fold size before taking the square root. Averaging five RMSEs directly is not exactly the same calculation.','R 中 outcome ~ predictors 表示模型，+ 添加项，lm 默认包含截距。每个候选用四折拟合、预测第五折，轮流五次。汇总时先按折人数加权平方误差，再开平方；直接平均五个 RMSE 不完全相同。'),
(48,'Select without test-set tuning / 不用测试集调参','Among models within 1% of the best cross-validated RMSE, prefer the fewest parameters. This declared practical rule avoids adding a shape term for a tiny gain. Fit the selected formula on all training rows. Assertions ensure that Income, Yield, Cat_Age and Cluster have not entered the primary predictor set.','在最佳交叉验证 RMSE 的 1% 以内优先参数最少的模型。这是明确的实用规则，避免为微小改善增加复杂项。随后在全部训练行拟合所选公式，并检查主预测变量未混入 Income、Yield、Cat_Age 或 Cluster。'),
(54,'Evaluate the primary model / 评价主模型','Extract coefficients with HC3 intervals, VIF and the training summary, then predict held-out records. The baseline predicts the TRAINING mean for everyone, which is available without test outcomes. The R2 denominator instead uses the evaluated-set mean by definition. Export both baseline and model errors so better-than-baseline does not mean error-free.','提取 HC3 系数区间、VIF 和训练摘要，再预测留出记录。可部署基准对所有人预测训练均值，不偷看测试结果；但 R² 定义中的分母使用当前评价集均值。把基准与模型误差一起保存，优于基准并不代表没有误差。'),
(63,'Training fit versus testing / 训练拟合与测试的区别','Training R2 measures in-sample explained variation; adjusted R2 penalises added parameters. The overall F test compares the fitted linear model with an intercept-only model under its assumptions. Residual standard error is measured in outcome units. These training quantities are not substitutes for held-out MAE, RMSE and R2. W8 covers the summary output.','训练 R² 描述样本内变异解释程度，调整 R² 对增加参数作惩罚。总体 F 检验在前提下比较当前线性模型与只有截距的模型。残差标准误有结果变量单位。训练指标不能替代测试 MAE、RMSE、R²；对应 W8 的摘要解读。'),
(72,'Investigate the constructed target / 检查衍生目标的来源','CLV is an existing estimate with an unknown formula. Add Income and Yield only as diagnostic variants to see whether fit resembles formula reconstruction. A higher score here does not validate future lifetime profit. Keep these variants labelled diagnostic rather than selecting whichever looks best on the test data.','CLV 是旧估计值，原公式未知。仅把加入 Income 和 Yield 的方案作为诊断，观察拟合是否可能在重构公式。这里分数更高不能验证真实未来利润，也不应按测试结果挑最漂亮者当主模型。'),
(77,'Impute using training information only / 仅用训练信息填补','Copy training and test data, calculate positive-income medians within training age categories, then apply those same values to zeros in each copy. get/assign retrieve and update the object named by a string. Keeping IncomeZero preserves the fact that the original value was zero. This hypothetical sensitivity scenario does not overwrite recorded raw income.','复制训练与测试数据，仅用训练集中各年龄类别的正收入算中位数，再把同一套数值应用到两份副本。get/assign 按文字名称读取、写回对象。保留 IncomeZero 记录原值为零的事实。这是假设性敏感性方案，不覆盖原始收入。'),
(85,'Compare target-provenance diagnostics / 比较目标来源诊断','rbind stacks error rows for the primary and diagnostic models on the same held-out outcomes. The saved table keeps the comparison transparent. An approximately 0.96 R2 when Income and Yield are included is consistent with a derived label, but neither proves the old formula nor forecasts true future cash flow.','rbind 把主模型与诊断模型在相同留出结果上的误差上下合并。保存表格让比较透明。加入 Income 与 Yield 后约 0.96 的 R² 与衍生标签相符，但既不能证明找回旧公式，也不能证明预测真实未来现金流。'),
(94,'Under-30 conditional association / 30 岁以下的条件关联','Add an Under30 indicator alongside a quadratic age shape and the core predictors. Compare its coefficient before and after adding Income and Yield. The indicator reflects an additional modelled difference conditional on those terms; it is not the raw group mean gap. Unknown true lifetime outcomes prevent interpreting it as a measured amount of underestimation.','在二次年龄形状和核心预测变量旁加入 Under30 指标，再比较加不加 Income、Yield 时的系数。该系数是给定其他项后的额外模型差异，不是原始均值差。缺少真实终身结果，不能把它当低估金额。'),
(105,'Residual and influence diagnostics / 残差与影响诊断','Residual=observed-fitted. Regressing squared residuals on fitted values produces a BP-style variance diagnostic n*R2, compared here with chi-square on one df. Cook distance summarises influence on the fit; leverage describes unusual predictor positions. Thresholds 4/n and 2p/n are screening conventions, not compulsory deletion rules.','残差=实际−拟合。将残差平方对拟合值回归，得到 BP 风格方差诊断 n×R²，这里与一自由度卡方分布比较。Cook 距离衡量对拟合的影响，杠杆值描述特殊输入位置。4/n 和 2p/n 只是筛查经验线，不是强制删除规则。'),
(122,'Sensitivity to extreme training records / 极端训练记录的敏感性','Estimate caps from training rows only and apply the transaction cap consistently to test predictors. The alternative model may cap TRAINING CLV, but evaluation always uses original test CLV. A second variant omits flagged training Cook records. Export coefficient and error changes; do not secretly replace the primary analysis after inspecting test improvements.','阈值只从训练行估计，并对测试输入应用相同交易阈值。替代模型可封顶训练 CLV，但评价始终使用原始测试 CLV。另一个方案移除训练中的 Cook 标记行。公开系数与误差变化，不能看完测试改善就偷偷换主分析。'),
(141,'Compare predictor contributions / 比较预测变量贡献','Remove one predictor block, refit the reduced model and compare residual sums of squares. Partial R2 divides the improvement by the reduced-model error; incremental R2 divides by total outcome variation. Their denominators differ, and block partial R2 values do not generally add to full R2. This avoids comparing slopes measured in incompatible units; it remains association, not causal importance.','每次移除一个变量块，重拟合简化模型并比较残差平方和。partial R² 以简化模型误差为分母，incremental R² 以结果总变异为分母。分母不同，各块 partial R² 通常不能相加得到总 R²。这样避免直接比较单位不同的系数，但仍不是因果重要性。'),
(153,'Secondary current-profit model / 补充当前利润模型','Yield is current profit, a different target from recorded lifetime value. Compare linear and quadratic age specifications using training folds, then evaluate the selected form on the same held-out records. CLV is excluded because its unknown construction may already use Yield. Low test R2 near 0.06 limits individual-profit prediction even if some coefficients are statistically significant.','Yield 是当前利润，与记录终身价值不同。用训练折比较线性与二次年龄形式，再在同一留出样本评价所选形式。排除 CLV，因为其未知构造可能已包含 Yield。测试 R² 约 0.06 表示个体利润预测较弱，即使某些系数显著也不能忽略。'),
(173,'Inspect subgroup errors / 检查分组误差','Save observed and predicted outcomes with row IDs, cluster and under-30 labels. Recompute error metrics separately within each subgroup to identify uneven performance. Clusters were built on all data and are used here only for descriptive error inspection, never as a regression predictor or tuning target. Small subgroups make errors less stable.','把实际值、预测值与行号、群号、年轻标记一起保存，再分组算误差以查看表现是否均匀。群体由全体数据形成，这里只作描述性误差检查，不作为回归输入或调参目标。小群的误差估计更不稳定。'),
(183,'Keep training and all-data models distinct / 区分训练模型与全数据模型','After evaluation, refit the selected formula on all records for a final saved specification. Its coefficients can differ from the training fit, so do not combine its fitted values with the earlier test-performance claim. The RDS keeps both models plus split and cap information. The original held-out results remain the reported evaluation.','评价完成后，在全部记录上重拟合所选公式并保存。其系数可与训练拟合不同，所以不能把全数据拟合值与早前测试表现混用。RDS 同时保存两种模型、切分与阈值；报告的评价仍来自原训练模型的留出结果。'),
(194,'Read the diagnostic plots / 阅读诊断图','plot.lm panels 1,2,3,5 show residual pattern, normal Q-Q, spread and leverage. The actual-versus-predicted plots include both full range and a zoom so extreme failures remain visible. Plotting a diagonal uses abline(0,1), meaning intercept zero and slope one. Display zooms never change the test metrics.','plot.lm 的 1、2、3、5 图分别检查残差规律、正态 Q–Q、波动与杠杆。预测对实际图同时保留全范围和放大图，不能藏起极端失败。abline(0,1) 是截距 0、斜率 1 的对角线。图形放大不会改变测试指标。'),
(206,'Hold other inputs fixed / 固定其他输入看年龄关联','Build example records with one product, training-median transactions and ages 18-99. X times beta gives the fitted mean; X V X-transpose gives its uncertainty. The shaded 95% HC3 band is for the mean response, not a prediction interval for an individual customer. The final Yield diagnostics and console summaries complete the model audit.','构造一个产品、训练交易中位数、年龄 18–99 的例子。X 乘 beta 得到拟合均值，X V X 转置给出不确定性。95% HC3 阴影描述均值，不是单个客户预测区间。最后输出 Yield 诊断和控制台摘要，完成模型审查。')])
add('04_report.R',[
(1,'Select evidence for interpretation / 选取解释所需证据','This module consumes objects already calculated; it does not refit models. It retrieves the primary test rows, selected coefficients and highest/lowest group indices. which.max returns an index, not the maximum value itself. Distinguish per-customer profit, total profit and recorded CLV when identifying business priorities.','本模块使用已经计算的对象，不重拟合模型。取测试结果、相关系数项及高低群位置；which.max 返回位置，不是最大值本身。确定业务重点时需区分人均利润、总利润与记录 CLV。'),
(17,'Tie actions to two evidence sources / 建议连接两类证据','Each recommendation records a target group, cluster evidence, model evidence, an action and a validation KPI. Dynamic text inserts computed amounts using fmt() instead of typing untraceable estimates. The proposals are pilots to test, not promised causal gains. No product type, channel cost or customer preference was observed in the dataset.','每条建议包括目标群、分群证据、模型证据、行动和验证指标。用 fmt() 将计算值插入文字，避免手填无法追溯的数字。建议是待验证试点，不是承诺因果收益；数据并未观察具体产品类型、渠道成本或偏好。'),
(44,'Record analytical decisions / 记录分析决策','The decisions table explains handling of zeros, negative profits, extremes, age duplication, repeated rows, model selection and target provenance. Keeping decisions beside results makes the analysis reviewable. The historical report below preserves the original analysis-stage statement that slides were deferred; final slides now live in the separate presentation deliverables.','决策表记录零值、负利润、极端值、年龄重复信息、重复行、模型选择和目标来源的处理。决策与结果放在一起便于审查。下方历史报告保留原分析阶段“暂不做 PPT”的文字；最终 PPT 已在独立演示交付目录完成。'),
(56,'Map rubric and classroom methods / 对照作业与课堂','Coverage connects each rubric requirement to exact result files; course_mapping links W3, W4, W6, W7 and W8 to methods used. Extensions have a specific reason: robust inference, multiple testing, generalisation or stability. This prevents adding methods just for decoration. The original phase checklist is historical, not the status of the newly completed slides.','要求对照表把每项要求指向具体结果，课程表连接 W3、W4、W6、W7、W8。补充方法分别服务稳健推断、多重检验、泛化或稳定性，不是为了堆方法。原阶段检查表是历史记录，不代表新 PPT 尚未完成。'),
(80,'Assemble the HTML document / 组装 HTML 文档','parts stores text fragments. add() appends to that outer object using <<-, while heading, para and fig wrap content in HTML tags. CSS controls appearance and responsive layout; it changes no statistics. Escaping text protects literal symbols, and relative links keep the report usable with its tables and plots folder.','parts 存放文字片段，add() 用 <<- 更新外层对象；heading、para、fig 给内容加 HTML 标签。CSS 只控制外观与小屏排版，不改统计值。转义保证符号按文字展示，相对链接让报告与 tables、plots 文件夹一同移动后仍可用。'),
(113,'Write the findings and data audit / 撰写发现与数据审计','The findings section collects major numerical results and their limits. Data preparation presents the dictionary, summaries, unusual-value screening and age-category mapping. Read the code strings as report prose, not executable commands. Tables come from calculated objects, whereas interpretation sentences explain the analyst reasoning.','主要发现汇总关键数字及限制。数据准备展示字典、概括、异常筛查和年龄映射。引号里的长段是报告文字，不是要执行的命令。表格来自已计算对象，解释文字说明分析者的推理。'),
(140,'Explain bivariate evidence / 解释双变量证据','The report inserts CLV correlations, two-group differences and age-band tests with linked CSV evidence. It distinguishes weak overall linear age correlation from non-linear grouped patterns. Mean differences and confidence intervals describe recorded labels; they cannot prove young customers are undervalued against unknown true lifetime profit.','报告插入 CLV 相关、两组差异和年龄段检验，并连接 CSV 证据。总体年龄线性相关弱，不等于分组形状没有规律。均值差与区间描述记录标签，无法对未知真实终身利润证明年轻客户被低估。'),
(162,'Explain the clustering decision / 解释分群选择','Present input justification, score comparison, two-versus-six tradeoff and full original-scale profiles. The text explicitly acknowledges overlapping groups and sensitivity to income handling. Passive outcomes help interpret profiles after clustering, not define an independently confirmed causal segmentation.','展示输入理由、分数比较、两群与六群取舍和原量纲画像。文字明确承认群间重叠以及收入处理的敏感性。被动盈利帮助解释画像，并不能形成独立确认的因果细分。'),
(192,'Explain regression performance / 解释回归表现','The regression section separates target provenance, data splitting, training selection, test error and conditional coefficients. Coefficients describe modelled change while holding included predictors constant. The observed product slope is not a guaranteed financial return from selling one more product.','回归部分区分目标来源、数据切分、训练选择、测试误差和条件系数。系数描述其他已纳入预测变量固定时的模型变化；产品系数不是再卖一个产品就必然得到的收益。'),
(214,'Explain limitations and sensitivity / 解释限制与敏感性','Insert residual diagnostics, VIF, alternative training treatments, target-reconstruction results and the under-30 contrast. Also show weak current-Yield performance. Robust SEs do not repair poor extreme-value prediction or establish independence. These caveats constrain how the recommendations should be used.','插入残差、VIF、替代训练处理、目标重构与年轻组条件差异，并展示当前 Yield 预测较弱。稳健标准误不修复极端值预测，也不证明独立性。这些限制决定建议应如何使用。'),
(235,'Publish actions and reproducibility / 写入行动与复现说明','The loop renders every recommendation with both evidence sources and a KPI. The closing sections collect limitations, runnable commands, code links, classroom mapping and every CSV table. writeLines writes the assembled HTML once. The next verification stage checks that these links and outputs actually exist.','循环展示每条建议的两类证据和 KPI，结尾汇总限制、运行命令、代码链接、课程对照及全部 CSV。writeLines 将组装好的 HTML 写入文件。下一阶段会实际检查这些链接和输出是否存在。')])
add('verify_results.R',[
(6,'Independent checks / 独立检查','Open a separate verification log. check() stops on the first failed condition and increments the pass counter only on success. eq() compares floating-point values with tolerance because tiny rounding differences can occur. readtab() loads the saved CSVs so checks are not merely inspecting the same in-memory object.','另开核验日志。check() 遇到失败立即停止，只有通过才累加计数。eq() 允许浮点计算的微小误差；readtab() 读取保存后的 CSV，避免只检查内存中同一个对象。'),
(15,'Verify source and summaries / 核对源数据与概括','Re-read raw data and compare its fixed MD5 fingerprint, dimensions and important counts. Recalculate means and medians directly from raw columns and compare with exported summaries. These independent calculations catch changed inputs, incorrect filtering or export mistakes.','重新读取原始数据，核对固定 MD5、维度和关键人数。直接从原列重算均值、中位数并与导出表比较。这可以发现输入变化、错误筛选或导出问题。'),
(27,'Verify clustering inputs / 核对聚类输入','Load the saved clustering object, reconstruct caps and standardisation, and compare the saved centring and SD values. Confirm excluded outcomes are absent and Lloyd converged. Then reconcile row IDs and group memberships. This checks how the model was formed, not merely its printed summary.','加载保存的聚类对象，重新应用阈值与标准化，比较保存的均值和标准差。确认盈利结果未混入输入，且 Lloyd 正常结束，再核对行号和归属。这是在检查模型形成过程，不只是看打印摘要。'),
(38,'Reconcile profiles and centroids / 对账画像与中心','Group counts must sum to 10,000 and shares to one. Recompute each group mean on original data; its size-weighted average must recover the overall mean. Category proportions must sum to one and totals must agree with raw profit. Standardised centroids must equal averages of their assigned observations.','各群人数必须合计 10,000，份额合计 1。用原始数据重算群均值，按人数加权后必须还原总体均值。类别比例合计 1，总利润与原数据一致，标准化中心等于所分配记录的平均值。'),
(51,'Verify selection evidence / 核对选择依据','Check that seven k candidates exist and exactly two have full silhouettes. The selected six must lie within the disclosed score tolerance and meet the minimum group-size rule. Also require a saved profile-comparison table. Passing means the recorded choice follows its stated rule, not that six is uniquely optimal.','检查七个候选 k 存在且只有两个有完整 silhouette，六群在公开容差内并达到最小规模规则，同时要求画像比较表存在。通过表示选择符合公开规则，不表示六群唯一最优。'),
(58,'Verify partitions and model provenance / 核对切分与模型来源','Reconcile model IDs, stored data and split assignments. Identical predictor groups must not cross train/test or CV folds. Check that primary predictors exclude risky variables and that the training model has training-row count while the refit has all rows. These checks protect the interpretation of held-out performance.','对照模型行号、保存数据和切分表。相同输入组合不能跨训练测试或交叉验证折。检查主输入排除风险变量，训练模型仅用训练行、重拟合用全部行。这些检查保护测试表现的含义。'),
(68,'Recompute predictions and errors / 重算预测与误差','Build X independently and multiply by saved coefficients rather than calling predict() for the CLV check. Compare every prediction and confirm test outcomes were never capped. Recalculate RMSE, MAE and R2 from the error vector and verify the deployable baseline uses only training outcomes.','独立构建 X 并乘保存系数，而不是再次调用 predict() 来核对 CLV。逐条比对预测，确认测试结果从未截尾。由误差向量重算 RMSE、MAE、R²，并确认可部署基准只用训练结果。'),
(80,'Verify secondary results and training rules / 核对补充结果与训练规则','Recompute Yield predictions and RMSE, check that cap percentiles come only from training rows, then independently apply the recorded 1%-simplicity CV rule. This checks that results match the selection plan without choosing a model from test errors.','重算 Yield 预测及 RMSE，核对阈值仅来自训练行，再独立应用 1% 内选简单模型的交叉验证规则。验证结果遵守选择计划，而不是从测试误差挑模型。'),
(88,'Independent HC3 identity / 独立核验 HC3','Base R dfbeta() gives coefficient changes associated with deleting one observation. The sum of squared changes for each coefficient equals the HC3 variance diagonal in this OLS identity. Comparing the square roots checks the custom sandwich helper against an independent computation. Intervals must also contain their point estimates.','基础 R 的 dfbeta() 给出删除单条观察相关的系数变化。在这里的 OLS 恒等式下，各系数变化平方和等于 HC3 方差对角线。开方后比较，独立检验自写三明治函数。还检查区间是否包住点估计。'),
(96,'Verify practical outputs / 核对实际交付物','Require at least three recommendations, each with clustering and model evidence. Check report existence and at least twelve nonempty PNGs. Read the first eight bytes of each image to verify its PNG signature rather than trusting the filename. These are file-integrity checks, not a substitute for visually reading plots.','要求至少三条建议，每条都有分群和模型证据。检查报告与至少十二张非空 PNG，读取每张前八字节核验 PNG 签名，而不是只信扩展名。这是文件完整性检查，不能代替实际看图。'),
(105,'Check links and finish / 检查链接并结束','Extract local href/src paths from the generated HTML and verify they resolve. Search for invalid numeric placeholders, then print the total passed checks and close the log. A successful run should report 63 checks passed on this source dataset. If any assertion fails, investigate it rather than deleting the check.','提取 HTML 的本地 href/src 路径并确认可打开，再查无效数字占位符，打印通过数量并关闭日志。本数据成功运行应报告 63 项通过。任何断言失败都应查原因，不能为了通过而删检查。')])
